@page "/about"

<h4>About Midnight Groove</h4>

<p>
    Midnight Groove is an independent record shop built for music lovers who still enjoy the feeling of discovering an album properly. 
    The shop focuses on classic records, timeless artists, and albums that have shaped different generations of music.
    The idea behind Midnight Groove is simple: every record has a story. Some albums remind people of where they grew up, 
    some introduce them to a completely new genre, and some become part of their everyday routine. The shop aims to make browsing 
    records feel personal, relaxed, and enjoyable.
</p>

<h4>Shop History</h4>

<p>
    Midnight Groove started as a small local record collection shared between friends. What began as a few shelves of favourite 
    albums slowly grew into a catalogue of rock, pop, soul, jazz, hip-hop, and alternative records. As more people started asking 
    about the collection, the idea of turning it into a proper record shop was born.
    The name “Midnight Groove” comes from the late-night listening sessions that inspired the shop. 
    It reflects the kind of music experience the shop wants to create: calm, memorable, and full of character.
</p>

<h4>What We Offer</h4>
<p>
    At Midnight Groove, users can browse available records, view album details, check prices and stock, and manage the catalogue. 
    The shop is designed to make it easy to discover records by title, artist, genre, and release year.
    The collection includes a mix of well-known classics and records that deserve a second listen. Whether someone is searching 
    for a legendary album or just exploring something new, Midnight Groove is built to make that experience simple.
</p>

